# ============================================================
#  Arcs (design §10.6): the main plot and character arcs as data.
#  acts: name@year · clock: range · beats: clock@yNmM (the clock
#  advances on schedule whatever the player does) · clues: what can
#  be found · key_clues: needed for the finale, each with ≥ 2
#  sources. Mechanics arrive in phase 2b; the structure in phase 3.
# ============================================================

@arc hollowstar
name: The Hollow Star
canon: hard
acts: omens@y1 investigation@y2 escalation@y3 convergence@y4
act_names: Omens, Investigation, Escalation, Convergence
# Each act opens at its opener's clock (content/events/hollowstar/threads.grim), so pushing opens it early.
act_clock: 1 4 7 10
clock: 0..12
beats: 1@y1m3 2@y1m9 4@y2m2 5@y2m9 7@y3m2 8@y3m7 10@y4m3 12@y4m9
clues: founders_ledger lake_bell second_shadow seven_locks star_key kael_family ilse_truth knows_founders_seal codex_names
key_clues: seven_locks star_key ilse_truth
cast: kael ilse isolde maud seraphine
act_rumours:
  They say the lake breathed on the first frost, and the bell under it rang with no one near.
  There's talk of a girl in white furs in the village, and of a man in grey who asks after the Dumonts.
  A tower went dark. Nobody says the word "cult" at supper, which is how you know everyone is thinking it.
  The lake has frozen early, and the headmistress has stopped pretending it hasn't.
epilogue: The Night is over. Whatever you chose beneath the lake, the castle wakes every morning around it now.
desc: Something that eats light sleeps beneath the Mirror Lake, behind a door the founders sealed with seven locks. Someone wants it open.

@arc lyra_and_her_mother
name: Second Place
canon: hard
acts: rivals@y1 cracks@y2 choice@y3
act_names: Rivals, Cracks, Choice
clock: 0..6
clues: black_seal_letters
cast: lyra
act_rumours:
  Everyone knows Lyra Vaneshade means to come first. Fewer know who she means to beat.
  Her mother's letters come with a black seal, and Lyra reads them alone.
  House Vaneshade expects an answer from its heir before she graduates.
desc: Lyra Vaneshade has never once heard "well done". Her rivalry with you can become respect, friendship or more, and her mother will have something to say about all three.

@arc kael_thaw
name: Thaw
canon: hard
acts: frost@y1 trust@y2 thaw@y3
act_names: Frost, Trust, Thaw
clock: 0..6
clues: kael_family
cast: kael
act_rumours:
  The transfer from the North doesn't feel the cold, they say, and doesn't sit with anyone.
  Kael has started sitting somewhere. People have noticed where.
  Letters come from the North more often now, and Kael answers fewer of them.
desc: Kael Dumont was sent to open a door and came to stop it. Whether he manages depends on whether anyone is warm enough.

@arc ilse_dumont
name: The Girl in White Furs
canon: hard
acts: arrival@y2 the_man_in_grey@y3 north@y4
act_names: Arrival, The Man in Grey, North
clock: 0..6
clues: ilse_truth
cast: ilse kael
act_rumours:
  A girl in white furs paid at the bakery with a coin that froze to the counter.
  The man in grey has been seen in the lanes after dark, asking after the girl in white.
  Letters with a black-star seal keep coming for Ilse.
desc: Kael's sister was raised by the Hollow cult to do what he wouldn't. The man in grey wants her home. She might let him.

@arc the_bell
name: The Bell Under the Water
canon: soft
acts: echo@y1 rope@y2
act_names: Echo, Rope
clock: 0..4
beats: 1@y1m2 2@y1m8 3@y2m3 4@y2m9
clues: bell_heard bell_rope bell_name
cast: maud
act_rumours:
  Some nights the drowned bell rings, and the fishermen won't say so in daylight.
  Old Maud has kept something of the bell for sixty years, they say, and she's starting to talk.
desc: The drowned bell under the Mirror Lake rings when no one is near it. Someone wants it found.
